-- ===== Top level =====
-- G1
#ASSERT (`the import position for` (`plain` 10000) `, ad valorem rate` 0.05 `, specific rate` 0 `, quantity` 0 `, payment facts` (`Duty facts` OF `s 124(3) an assessment under s 113`, Date 2 11 2026, NOTHING, (LIST (Payment OF (Date 8 12 2026), 500))) `, Matariki days` `Matariki` `, as at` (Date 31 12 2026)) EQUALS (`Import position` OF 10000, 500, Date 30 11 2026, 25)
